</span><span style=3D"color: #009900">}</span><span style=3D"color: #000099=
"></span>
</span></pre>
                                                            </li>

                                                            <li>
                                                                <p>Your app=
lication asks the user to go to the <b>verification</b> endpoint (provided =
by <i>verification_url</i>) and to type the code provided by <i>user_code</=
i>.</p>
