id=3D"device_auth_no_secret">
                                                        <h3>Workflow for op=
ensource apps</h3>

                                                        <p>This authenticat=
ion process is similar to OAuth2 for mobile devices, with the difference th=
at opensource apps or scripts can not be shipped with a <b>client_secret</b=
> (since it's meant to remain secret).</p>
