lert-warning"><strong>Warning:</strong> You should not redistribute the cre=
dentials. Usage with another account will display the UID of the user who o=
btained the credentials. E.g. instead of displaying "The most fabulous app"=
 it will display "The most fabulous app (UID: 000)".</p>

                                                        <p>The following UR=
Ls are used in this process:</p>

                                                        <ul>
